  "text": "Rocket 4 Plus - G Support documentation? | Welcome Forum Support Customer Support Rocket 4 Plus - G Support documentation? Rocket 4 Plus - G Support documentation? Rocket 4 Plus G Technical Support Dual-Sided M.2 SSD S Steve 12/16/22, 5:27 PM Would anyone be able to provide the appropriate documentation for the new Rocket 4 Plus - G or a link for me to obtain it?  I just received mine and I want to make sure that any judgement I make plays fair.  Also, in case it isn't there, since the 2TB and 4TB models are dual-sided, do you folks recommend proper thermal contact via thermal pads between the drive and the m.2 slot's pcb?  If so, can you provide a recommended pad thickness? 0 likes Liked Like Copy link 3 Posts 601 Views Reply S Sabrent Admin Staff 12/18/22, 7:45 PM @Steve If you mean the specs and you received the 4TB model, it should be similar to the updated Rocket 4 Plus: Up to 7200/6850 MB/s, 940K/1000K 4K IOPS, 3000TBW I will also pass on the suggestion that we do a datasheet, although usually we do provide a table with explicit specifications. I will ask about the cooling but it is best to at least cool the controller, if possible, and the M.2 spec for SSDs has a defined maximum height for dual-sided drives that should assist you in determining thermal pad thickness for the rear. 0 likes Liked Like Copy link S Sabrent Admin Staff 12/18/22, 8:38 PM @Steve Reading up on this it seems the specifications for M.2 vary. Typically the PCB is 0.8mm +/- 10%, the M.2 socket is 2.25mm center, and the rear componentry is 1.35mm. Thermal padding of 0.5mm should work but 0.75mm may be better for maximum pressure. This is something I will try to have our team test. 1 likes Liked Like Copy link Please login to reply to this topic! Related topics Rocket 4 Plus G Thermal Performance With Motherboard Heatsink PseudoPsyche 7/10/23, 10:56 PM 4 Pre-Sales Questions » Availability of support outside NA? Christopher Hill 3/27/23, 10:04 PM 2 Sabrent Shopping » Availability of support outside NA? Christopher Hill 3/27/23, 10:04 PM 2 Sabrent Shopping » Rocket 4 Plus G (SB-RKTB-4TB) Performance Issues Ryan Haver 10/11/22, 12:40 AM 8 Customer Support » Rocket 4 Plus G SKUs - single-sided or double-sided? Rene Schuchter 9/20/22, 12:16 AM 3 Pre-Sales Questions » Participants S Sabrent 12/18/22, 8:38 PM S Steve 12/16/22, 5:27 PM © 2026, Sabrent | Powered by Xenforum People who liked this Close Ok Email Verification An email with a verification link will be sent to your email address. [Email is not found] Cancel Send Please login to continue Please log in or register to continue Login Register Search View all: Topics | Posts | Members",
